d/bazel/issues/comments/565403252","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6870#issuecomment-565403252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6870","id":565403252,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NTQwMzI1Mg==","user":{"login":"NikolayPianikov","id":11720017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzIwMDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11720017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov","html_url":"https://github.com/NikolayPianikov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-12-13T11:12:42Z","updated_at":"2019-12-13T11:12:42Z","body":"I have the same issue: `FATAL: mkdir('/home/abc/system/bazel/root'): (error: 13): Permission denied`\r\n\r\nI build a project in docker container `l.gcr.io/google/bazel:latest`\r\nI map docker volume `-v /home/abc/system:/home/abc/system` to improve a performance for repeatable builds.\r\nI do not change user in a docker container.\r\nI run the command under `builduser` user account: `bazel --output_user_root=/home/abc/system/bazel/root build -- :ProjectRunner` in docker.\r\nAnd it works at first time, but it fails at second and at others with error above till I delete the directory `/home/abc/system/bazel/root`.\r\n\r\n`ls -l` from the host machine after first build is:\r\n`drwxr-xr-x 5 builduser builduser`\r\n\r\nWhen I do the same under the root user at host everething is ok.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/565403252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"NikolayPianikov","id":11720017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzIwMDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11720017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov","html_url":"https://github.com/NikolayPianikov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikolayPianikov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/628234001","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6870#issuecomment-628234001","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6870","id":628234001,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYyODIzNDAwMQ==","user":{"login":"jmmv","id":879272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTI3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv","html_url":"https://github.com/jmmv","followers_ur