ser","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/628838757","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6870#issuecomment-628838757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6870","id":628838757,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYyODgzODc1Nw==","user":{"login":"jmmv","id":879272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTI3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv","html_url":"https://github.com/jmmv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-14T19:21:06Z","updated_at":"2020-05-14T19:25:23Z","body":"Oh wow, took quite a bit of archaeology to reach the problem. The `CreateSecureUserRoot` and `MakeDirectories` functions have moved *so* many times...\r\n\r\nThis broke starting in 46af79d4c7401877cc34bf3a321624d8aa96923b, which \"helpfully\" changed a plain `mkdir` call with `MakeDirectories`. Then, in 237ba6c4e45d88baee602635883f4b03d4d7c322, `MakeDirectories` gained the feature to ensure the last path component is owned by the calling user. And boom, this untested feature broke.\r\n\r\nOh wait, no, the rabbit hole goes deeper. `CreateSecureUserRoot` already had some code to ensure the directory has the same owner. Huh. Continuing to dig.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/628838757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jmmv","id":879272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTI3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv","html_url":"https://github.com/jmmv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/628843934","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6870#issuecomment-628843934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6870","id":628843934,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYyODg0MzkzNA==","user":{"login":"jmmv","id":879272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTI3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv","html_url":"https://github.com/jmmv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-14T19:32:13Z","updated_at":"2020-05-14T19:32:13Z","body":"OK, so this was an intentional change but unfortunately it's from cl/69071385 (not available in Git, back from 2014). The change description provides no rationale for the change other than \"be paranoid with directory creation\", and we have an integration test to verify that the user root cannot actually be shared among users.\r\n\r\nI understand why this may be desirable when the output root goes, by default, into a temporary directory that may be shared across users. And it does, e.g. as in #11100.\r\n\r\nSo... I think the answer here is to change the documentation to say that this is not supported instead of trying to fix this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/628843934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jmmv","id":879272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTI3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv","html_url":"https://github.com/jmmv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users